    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/48bf4f2fda72a49cf6d69647ca5dee75.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After their ultimate battle with Fujin and Raijin, Hiro and his companions enjoyed peaceful days at his grandfather's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day in Japan, Sanbi sensed a distant summons. Troubled by the call, she informed Hiro. After thorough research and careful energy tracing, they discovered its source\u2014her main body, the legendary nine-tailed fox, residing somewhere in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to uncover the truth, Hiro, Sanbi and Yoshiko set off on a journey to The Land of Dragons, ready to face whatever awaited them and unravel the mystery behind Sanbi\u2019s summons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/1a9461a1d3d6f60fcf7c7606c8f58eeb.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/d079125d6a9d5ebe5754928ee6cc7fd1.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/6312e3e8fd4b871f1d6b3b349c04d83a.avif?t=1754046732\" width=573 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will now navigate their adventure on a hex-based map featuring diverse floor designs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/49e82c68eb52ba4e4bf454a757dd40f3.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/49e82c68eb52ba4e4bf454a757dd40f3.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/49e82c68eb52ba4e4bf454a757dd40f3.mp4?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various hex-node types, including battles, treasure chests, and scenario events, to strengthen your units.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Hiro\u2019s abilities after each run to take on even more formidable foes!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collects god's boon and relics to improve your team power.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/2f847f9ff7438fc175735281dcf8f711.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/2f847f9ff7438fc175735281dcf8f711.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/2f847f9ff7438fc175735281dcf8f711.mp4?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b2ba027066dfac13c8416040cfb66773.avif?t=1754046732\" width=634 height=626 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/ebb178823f96a9ecff0bb104ae4d0503.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautifully crafted world inspired by both\u00a0Chinese folklore and Japanese yokai.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat supernatural enemies and gather spiritual energy to empower your units.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your units on a chessboard-inspired battlefield to defend your realm.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead to overcome powerful bosses and waves of mythical minions.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face legendary creatures from Chinese and Japanese tales \u2014 each with unique combat styles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/5dcbc0a609593eb6dc422c72a507432b.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse cast of mythical creatures from Chinese and Japanese folklore, each with distinct abilities and behavior. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against powerful elite enemies and epic bosses waiting to be conquered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/c5b9c96283419a4e82b2ddc03b1c8475.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/c5b9c96283419a4e82b2ddc03b1c8475.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/6ae9e092e1052ed7323a9c99c7ca34d4.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your units on a chessboard-inspired battlefield to defend your realm.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness Powerstones to evolve your units into their ultimate forms and unleash powerful skill attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b49f10427104f2d07e73222b31eb94ef.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=600 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b49f10427104f2d07e73222b31eb94ef.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b49f10427104f2d07e73222b31eb94ef.mp4?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/48bf4f2fda72a49cf6d69647ca5dee75.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After their ultimate battle with Fujin and Raijin, Hiro and his companions enjoyed peaceful days at his grandfather's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day in Japan, Sanbi sensed a distant summons. Troubled by the call, she informed Hiro. After thorough research and careful energy tracing, they discovered its source\u2014her main body, the legendary nine-tailed fox, residing somewhere in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to uncover the truth, Hiro, Sanbi and Yoshiko set off on a journey to The Land of Dragons, ready to face whatever awaited them and unravel the mystery behind Sanbi\u2019s summons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/1a9461a1d3d6f60fcf7c7606c8f58eeb.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/d079125d6a9d5ebe5754928ee6cc7fd1.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/6312e3e8fd4b871f1d6b3b349c04d83a.avif?t=1754046732\" width=573 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will now navigate their adventure on a hex-based map featuring diverse floor designs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/49e82c68eb52ba4e4bf454a757dd40f3.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/49e82c68eb52ba4e4bf454a757dd40f3.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/49e82c68eb52ba4e4bf454a757dd40f3.mp4?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various hex-node types, including battles, treasure chests, and scenario events, to strengthen your units.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Hiro\u2019s abilities after each run to take on even more formidable foes!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collects god's boon and relics to improve your team power.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/2f847f9ff7438fc175735281dcf8f711.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/2f847f9ff7438fc175735281dcf8f711.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/2f847f9ff7438fc175735281dcf8f711.mp4?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b2ba027066dfac13c8416040cfb66773.avif?t=1754046732\" width=634 height=626 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/ebb178823f96a9ecff0bb104ae4d0503.avif?t=1754046732\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautifully crafted world inspired by both\u00a0C