o defend your realm.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness Powerstones to evolve your units into their ultimate forms and unleash powerful skill attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b49f10427104f2d07e73222b31eb94ef.poster.avif?t=1754046732\" width=600 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b49f10427104f2d07e73222b31eb94ef.webm?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405160/extras/b49f10427104f2d07e73222b31eb94ef.mp4?t=1754046732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
